#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:6
msgid "Calligra Sheets"
msgstr "Calligra Sheets"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:7
msgid "Spreadsheet"
msgstr "Proračunska tablica"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "Calligra Sheets is a fully-featured calculation and spreadsheet tool. Use it to quickly create and calculate various business-related spreadsheets, such as income and expenditure, employee working hours, etc."
msgstr "Calligra Sheets je potpuno opremljen alat za izračune i proračunske tablice. Koristite ga za brzo stvaranje i izračunavanje različitih poslovnih tablica, primjerice prihoda i rashoda, radnih sati zaposlenika i slično."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:13
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Značajke:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:15
msgid "Use shapes to take notes or mind maps"
msgstr "Koristite oblike za bilješke ili umne mape"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:16
msgid "Large range of pre-defined templates"
msgstr "Velik izbor unaprijed definiranih predložaka"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:17
msgid "Powerful and comprehensive formula list"
msgstr "Moćan i opsežan popis formula"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:18
msgid "Work in a familiar environment"
msgstr "Rad u poznatom okruženju"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:69
msgid "This release add flatpak support to the Calligra Office suite."
msgstr "Ovo izdanje dodaje podršku za Flatpak uredskom paketu Calligra."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:75
msgid "The most significant changes are that Calligra has been fully transitioned to Qt6 and KF6, along with a major overhaul of its user interface."
msgstr "Najznačajnije su promjene potpuni prijelaz Calligre na Qt 6 i KF 6 te temeljita obnova korisničkog sučelja."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligra.sheets.metainfo.xml:76
msgid "As part of the Qt6 port, Sheets lost its scripting system based on the unmaintained Kross framework. Visually a noticable change is that the cell editor moved from a docker positioned on the left of the spreadsheet view by default to a normal widget on the top. This takes a lot less space which can be used by the spreadsheet."
msgstr "U sklopu prijenosa na Qt 6, Sheets je izgubio sustav skriptiranja temeljen na neodržavanom okviru Kross. Vidljiva je promjena premještanje uređivača ćelija iz priključnog prozora, koji je zadano bio lijevo od proračunske tablice, u uobičajeni grafički element na vrhu. Time se oslobađa mnogo prostora za samu proračunsku tablicu."
